              "label": "290c259"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "summary": "Five votes a day, and winning makes it slopcessful",
          "details_markdown": "Everyone now gets five votes per UTC day, up or down, so each one counts in the race for slop of the day. Switching today's vote is free, taking one back gives it back, and today's race shows how many you have left. Nobody marks their own slop slopcessful any more: the slop with the most votes when the day ends wins slop of the day and goes slopcessful, straight into the hall of fame.",
          "change_type": "user_feat",
          "bump": "minor",
          "stream": "user",
          "style": "compact",
